  "steps": [
    "Heat ½ tbsp ghee in a pan on low-medium heat.",
    "If using, add the crushed cashews and almonds and lightly roast them in the ghee.",
    "Add 20g besan and roast on low heat, stirring continuously, until it turns golden brown and smells beautifully nutty.",
    "Grind/crush the turmeric and black peppercorns together, add them to the roasted besan along with zero-calorie sweetener mix well.",
    "Add the raisins to boiling water. Then slowly pour in ½ cup boiling water, a little at a time in the besan, while stirring continuously to prevent lumps.",
    "Gradually add 100 ml skimmed milk, continuing to stir. Don’t pour it all in at once!!",
    "Cook on low heat for another 4–5 minutes, stirring continuously, until smooth, creamy and properly cooked.",
    "If you prefer a thinner, more drinkable consistency, add a little more hot water."
